        "official_en_sha256": "e8a7eff3a0aec32f38ddcc09b8c5d7dd8562484f770df1d32271a3e0cdb6062b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あいつは自分を犠牲にしてまで\r\n国を救おうとしている。ジェイクと一緒なら\r\n俺たちも命をかけて戦えるぜ。",
        "official_en": "He’s willing to sacrifice himself to save the country. With Jake by our side, we’re ready to fight to the death, too.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
