        "official_en_sha256": "4717e3f7b96eb08aa26d25f9bde29da5c671ca038f2c6e1423c7938cadc9ef0f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何がソゼ皇帝を戦争に駆り立てるのか。\r\n私には全く理解できないよ。",
        "official_en": "But why he wants to go to war, I haven’t the foggiest.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
