    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_415_01:415_01_005:0b7b8743",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C04_415_01",
        "key": "415_01_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_415_01:415_01_005:0b7b8743",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_415_01:415_01_005:0b7b8743",
        "jp_sha256": "52c73d8b0b243ac6a2260e96dedac9cfca84f7a4ebd1ff54f8b4d502fb3d7dfd",
        "official_en_sha256": "7052d3e2591352fd6c2eab30bda06b61fc4768d610aac4580d094b5f5107aa2b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "無駄な血を流すことはしない御方だったのに\r\n国民に無理を強いてまで\r\n軍備拡大に舵をきるなんて……。",
